      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Isolated non-osseous tarsal coalition of the medial cuneiform-first metatarsal joint is rare. Resection of the coalition was performed in a 32-year-old patient, with excellent results. This procedure is an effective option for treatment of small lesions."},
